   "message": "Add cryptanalysis of the unsolved SalPhaseIon/Cosmic Duality endgame\n\n- FINDINGS.md: full falsification-driven analysis (VIC/straddling-checkerboard\n  diagnosis, dbbi=key vs faed=payload via IoC, escape digits ~1,4, the\n  verification problem, all falsified hypotheses)\n- _work/: validated tools (cb2.py reproduces phase 3.2.2), hill-climber,\n  chat parser, AES helpers, and every attack script\n- key data: blobs, creator messages, Game-of-Logic OCR, parsed transcript\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
