   "message": "Add joint 4-parameter attack with end-of-chain AES verification\n\njoint_attack.py enumerates {alphabet x mapping x escapes x transposition x\nover-encryption} and verifies only via the real oracle (sha256(answer) opening\nthe blob), not the unreliable English score. 4904 decode-forms tested, 0 hits.\nFormalizes why the endgame is computationally unbreakable without the correct\nalphabet interpretation (26! space, binary AES oracle, no gradient).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
